nt."},{"q":"Can I schedule uninstallation for multiple AC units during the same service?","a":"Each uninstallation service is typically specific to one AC unit. For multiple units, additional service requests may be needed."},{"q":"What should I do with the AC unit after uninstallation?","a":"Our technicians can provide advice on storage or relocation. If needed, we offer installation services at a new location."},{"q":"Is the 7-day service warranty applicable to all aspects of uninstallation?","a":"Yes, the warranty covers the entire uninstallation process. If issues arise within the warranty period, we''ll address them promptly."},{"q":"Can I keep the AC components for future use?","a":"Yes, you can keep the components for future use. Our technicians will provide guidance on proper storage."}]' WHERE slug = 'ac-uninstallation';
