9. AC Dismantling: This service offers dismantling AC from home or workplace and disconnecting all the electrical wiring from the AC unit.

10. AC Capacitor Replacement: This service offers to replace the AC capacitor with a new one. Capacitor price and warranty differ as per manufacturer.

11. AC Circuit Repairing: This service offers to repair the circuits of your AC. Circuit box price and warranty differ as per manufacturer.

Why Choose Us

- Dedicated Key Account Manager (KAM): We believe in personalized service. Each client is assigned a Dedicated Key Account Manager to ensure seamless communication, address specific needs, and provide tailored solutions.

- Expert and Reliable Technicians: Our team consists of highly skilled and experienced technicians. You can trust us to deliver reliable services, backed by expertise in the field.

- Professional Consultation: We offer professional consultation to guide you through service options, answer queries, and provide recommendations for optimal solutions tailored to your requirements.

- Best Price Assurance: Quality service doesn''t have to break the bank. We are committed to providing competitive and transparent pricing, ensuring you get the best value for your investment.', included_json = NULL, not_included_json = NULL, faqs_json = '[{"q":"How often should I schedule commercial AC service?","a":"Regular service is recommended at least twice a year for optimal performance."},{"q":"Can you service multiple AC units within the same appointment?","a":"Yes, our technicians can service multiple units during a single appointment. Please provide details during scheduling."},{"q":"What is the typical duration of a commercial AC service?","a":"The service duration varies based on the number of units and their complexity. Our technicians will provide an estimate during the initial inspection."},{"q":"Is the 7-day service warranty applicable to all aspects of the service?","a":"Yes, the warranty covers the entire scope of the service. If issues arise within the warranty period, we''ll address them promptly."},{"q":"Do you offer emergency commercial AC service?","a":"Yes, we provide emergency services. Please contact our customer support for immediate assistance."},{"q":"Can you handle major repairs during the service?","a":"Major repairs may require a separate appointment due to time constraints during routine service. Our technicians will assess and provide recommendations."}]' WHERE slug = 'ac-corporate-service';
